From: mscharged-port
Subject: Admit the debug LAN lobby from Main Menu
Upstream-base: 7a6bf165d9f1c5914181c079c7d4bfa7204f3509
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission

Retail never calls NetworkSession::InitializeLAN. Under
MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_LAN, Main Menu's Online item starts a LAN
session and pushes the original lobby (scene 24, NetworkStartScene)
instead of the DWC login, or shows POPUP_NETWORK_START_FAILED if the
session does not start. The lobby's back button shuts the session down
and returns to Main Menu. The scene factory admits the lobby and the
network draft scenes; hub, login, Mii selection and every DWC scene keep
their gates.

